# scenes/olympus_temple.scene
#
# "The Sunken Sanctuary of Helios"
#
# A classical Greek marble colonnade and sanctuary submerged in an emerald
# reflecting pool at golden sunset.
#
# Key Highlights:
#   * Hellenistic colonnade with classical tapered columns, entablature, and pediment
#   * Floating solar relic: radiant golden emissive core (area light) encircled by a tilted celestial halo
#   * Noble PBR metals: polished gold, silver mirror, copper, and ruby glass
#   * Animated water with Fresnel reflections and deep teal Beer-Lambert absorption
#   * Submerged checkered marble basin visible through crystal-clear water
#   * Mediterranean cypress trees framing the scene
#   * Low golden-hour sun with soft penumbral shadows (sun_radius 3.5)
#   * Thin-lens depth of field focused on the central solar altar
#
# Render:
#   ./raytracer --scene scenes/olympus_temple.scene --pathtrace \
#               --width 1280 --height 720 --samples 32 --depth 6 \
#               --out output/olympus_temple.bmp

